# Pairs with HandOffBound. A rejected range-delete walk whose own intent has
# closed is appended stamped with the generation the fence grain hands out now,
# instead of unstamped and reported. It passes the re-claimed entry and is
# allocated above the head the close recorded, with no marker holding L.
MODULE: HandOffBoundUnstampedFallbackStamped
TARGET: HandOffBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a walk whose intent has closed goes on stamped with the current generation instead of unstamped
PERTURBS: GUnstamped

--- FIND
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = "u"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: stamped with the current generation, not unstamped.
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = "g"]
--- END
